flowchart Which regex engine builds the matcher
// From: crates/core/flags/hiargs.rs:368-409,461-514
direction-tb

(HiArgs::matcher) -> <Engine choice?>
<Engine choice?> -default-> [matcher_rust]
<Engine choice?> -pcre2-> [matcher_pcre2]
<Engine choice?> -auto-> [Try matcher_rust]
[matcher_rust] -> <Rust regex compiled?>
<Rust regex compiled?> -yes-> (RustRegex matcher)
<Rust regex compiled?> -no-> (Error suggesting --pcre2)
[matcher_pcre2] -> <PCRE2 compiled?>
<PCRE2 compiled?> -yes-> (PCRE2 matcher)
<PCRE2 compiled?> -no-> (Error)
[Try matcher_rust] -> <Rust regex compiled in auto mode?>
<Rust regex compiled in auto mode?> -yes-> (RustRegex matcher)
<Rust regex compiled in auto mode?> -no-> [Try matcher_pcre2]
[Try matcher_pcre2] -> <PCRE2 compiled in auto mode?>
<PCRE2 compiled in auto mode?> -yes-> (PCRE2 matcher)
<PCRE2 compiled in auto mode?> -no-> (Error showing both engine errors)

note matcher_rust `build_many` feeds a RegexMatcherBuilder, hiargs.rs:461
note matcher_pcre2 hiargs.rs:411 is an error unless the pcre2 feature is on
note "Engine choice?" hiargs.rs:369 EngineChoice Default, PCRE2 or Auto
